label("$4$",P(2,0,0),S);label("$4$",P(6,0,0),S);
label("\mbox{}",(min(currentpicture,user=true)+max(currentpicture,user=true))/2,black); // keeps the text after the figure black when LaTeX typesets the labels inline
\end{asy}

They occupy $8\cdot64=512$ of the $1000$ cubic units, so the fraction filled is $\dfrac{512}{1000}=\boxed{51.2\%}$.

Count pairs (face, corner of that face) in two ways. The faces have
