[DEF]=\dfrac{1}{2}\left|\dfrac{49}{10}\cdot\dfrac{2q}{7}-\dfrac {q}{2}\cdot\left(-\dfrac{1}{7}\right)\right|=\dfrac{1}{2}\left(\dfrac{7q}{5}+\dfrac{q}{14}\right)=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot\dfrac{103q}{70}=\dfrac{103q}{140}.
